SUMMARY:SciREN Triangle and Educator Open House
DESCRIPTION:SAVE THE DATE! Join us for our annual Educator Open House and SciREN Triangle Networking Event on Thursday\, September 24\, 2026 from 6:00–8:30pm. This special information exchange night is just for educators and will feature local scientists\, Museum educators and partner organizations showcasing their FREE lesson plans and resources in a relaxed environment. Learn about new programs and field trips\, outreach and virtual programs\, and professional development opportunities. \nThrough a partnership with SciREN (Scientific Research and Education Network)\, meet local scientists ready to distribute curriculum-correlated lessons based on their current research! This is an excellent way to rejuvenate teaching methods\, integrate relevant and real science into student learning\, and reach out into the community. \nWhat to Expect\n\nFree: dinner!!\nFree: beverages courtesy of New Belgium Brewing\nFree: curriculum-correlated K–12 lesson plans (including digital access)\nOpportunities to talk 1:1 with scientists\nInformation about program offerings from the Museum and other partner organizations\nTake a tour of the Museum’s galleries and exhibits.\nLearn about upcoming professional development opportunities.\n\nEvent Details\nFREE\, but registration is required. \nIf you are an EDUCATOR\, register here! \nIf you are a SCIENTIST or EXHIBITOR\, register here! \nLocation: NC Museum of Natural Sciences\, Nature Exploration Center — Directions and Parking \nFor additional information about this event\, contact Megan Davis at megan.davis@naturalsciences.org
URL:https://www.naturalsciences.org/calendar/event/sciren-triangle-and-educator-open-house/
LOCATION:Nature Exploration Center\, 11 West Jones Street\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27601\, United States
CATEGORIES:Educator Treks,Educators,General Events,Workshops
ORGANIZER;CN="Megan%20Davis":MAILTO:megan.davis@naturalsciences.org
GEO:35.7822735;-78.6395502
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Nature Exploration Center 11 West Jones Street Raleigh NC 27601 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=11 West Jones Street:geo:-78.6395502,35.7822735
END:VEVENT
