UID:123525-1790362800-1790371800@www.naturalsciences.org
SUMMARY:iNaturalist Together After Dark
DESCRIPTION:All programs at Prairie Ridge currently require registration.  Register\nJoin fellow iNaturalist users for an evening at Prairie Ridge as we investigate the wildlife that is active at night. We’ll sweep net for insects\, take a short walk to the pond to listen for frogs and birds\, and have light stations to attract moths and other nocturnal insects. Bring a flashlight and a smartphone or camera so you can photograph and document what you see. \nThis program includes a brief introduction to iNaturalist\, including a few advanced features you may not know about before we head out to the frog and insect stations. Show up with iNaturalist already installed on your phone and a flashlight for the best experience!
URL:https://www.naturalsciences.org/calendar/event/inaturalist-together/
LOCATION:Prairie Ridge\, 1671 Gold Star Drive\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27607\, United States
CATEGORIES:Adults,Collaborative Science,Educators,K-12 Students,Outdoor Experiences,Teens
ORGANIZER;CN="Chris%20Goforth":MAILTO:chris.goforth@naturalsciences.org
GEO:35.812182885871;-78.713963528554
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Prairie Ridge 1671 Gold Star Drive Raleigh NC 27607 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=1671 Gold Star Drive:geo:-78.713963528554,35.812182885871
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
